--- !u!114 &57282751
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 57282749}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><color=#FBBF24>THE IDEA</color></b>\nProcesses (the blocks on the arena
    floor) wait in the <b>ready queue</b> for the one <b>CPU core</b>. The scheduler
    picks who runs next: FCFS, SRTF, Priority or Round Robin. The Gantt board shows
    the order and the waiting times.\n\n<b><color=#FBBF24>CONTROLS</color></b>\nUse
    a <b>workstation desk</b> to choose an algorithm, the <b>console</b> to run,
    step or reset, the <b>process editor</b> to change bursts, and the <b>challenge
    wall</b> for the quiz.\n<b>Desktop</b>  WASD walk, mouse look, <b>E</b> or click
    to use what the dot points at, <b>U</b> simulator window.\n<b>Phone</b>  thumbstick
    to walk, drag to look, tap to use.\n<b>Headset</b>  point and pull the trigger
    (or pinch) to use. <b>A</b> run / pause, <b>B</b> step, <b>X</b> simulator window.\n<b>Headset</b> 
    left stick walk, right stick turn (push up to teleport). Look at a controller
    to see its buttons.\n<b>Hands</b>  point + pinch to select; pinch the ground
    and release to teleport; pinch + flick sideways to turn; left palm up for MENU.\n<b>Mixed
    reality</b> (Settings \u2192 Display)  your room around a table model: right
    stick resize, left stick turn, click the right stick to bring it back in front."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
